@startuml lte-packet-private
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
title LTE Packet Core/EPC: детальный поток политики PCC

actor "Application / IMS AF" as AF
actor "OSS/BSS\nprovisioning" as OSS
database "HSS\nIMSI, APN list,\nsubscribed QCI/AMBR" as HSS
database "PCRF policy DB\nPCC rules,\nsubscriber tiers,\nservice policies" as PDB
rectangle "PCRF\nPolicy and Charging\nRules Function" as PCRF
rectangle "P-GW / PCEF\nPolicy and Charging\nEnforcement Function" as PCEF
rectangle "MME\nEPS bearer control" as MME
rectangle "eNodeB\nRAN admission + scheduler" as ENB
cloud "User traffic\nIMS / Internet / Corporate" as TRAF

OSS --> HSS : subscriber/APN profile
OSS --> PDB : tariff, group policy,\nQoS templates
AF --> PCRF : Rx request\nservice QoS
HSS --> MME : subscription during attach
PDB --> PCRF
PCRF --> PCEF : Gx PCC rule\nTFT/SDF + QCI/ARP/GBR/MBR
PCEF --> MME : bearer create/modify
MME --> ENB : E-RAB setup\nQCI/ARP/GBR
TRAF --> PCEF : IP packets
PCEF --> TRAF : shaping/gating/charging
ENB --> TRAF : radio scheduling\nbased on bearer QoS

note bottom
Групповое качество задается в OSS/BSS и PCRF:
например "premium data", "enterprise APN",
"VoLTE", "public safety". P-GW применяет IP policy,
eNodeB превращает ее в радио-приоритет.
end note
@enduml
